%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '22px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(VouchersController + VouchersService)
    participant Vouchers as MongoDB (vouchers)

    Note over Admin,Vouchers: CREATE — POST /vouchers (chi Admin)
    Admin->>FE: Nhap thong tin voucher
    FE->>BE: POST /vouchers { code, discountType, discountValue,<br/>minOrderValue, maxDiscountAmount, usageLimit, expiredAt }
    BE->>Vouchers: findOne({ code, deletedAt: null })

    alt Ma voucher da ton tai
        Vouchers-->>BE: voucher document
        BE-->>FE: 409 Ma voucher da ton tai
        FE-->>Admin: Hien thi loi
    else Chua ton tai
        Vouchers-->>BE: null
        BE->>BE: code.toUpperCase().trim()
        Note over BE: Chuan hoa ma truoc khi luu —<br/>dam bao dong nhat, tranh trung lap do hoa thuong/thuong
        BE->>Vouchers: create({ code, discountType, discountValue,<br/>minOrderValue, maxDiscountAmount, usageLimit, expiredAt })
        Vouchers-->>BE: voucher moi
        BE-->>FE: 201 { voucher }
        FE-->>Admin: Tao voucher thanh cong
    end
